  "title": "EVKITST87M01-2 - HST (High Speed Interface) Dongle HST Logger",
  "content": "<p>Hi all, </p><p>Regarding EVKIOTST87M01-2. In the design guide is mentioned the High Speed Interface (HST), in the same guide specifies that this interface requires an external Hardware TPA device, named Dongle HST Logger to recover the data flow for ST Analysis. </p><p>The questions are:<br />Do you sale this Dongle HST Logger? Is the ST-Link compatible?<br />or is the the data available through the STSW-ST87M GUI?</p><p>Thanks in advance. <br />Susana </p>",
